    "May": "Cares about software longevity and the quality of external hand-offs. She dislikes systems that age poorly or require constant repair after migration.",
    "Ryuji": "Cares about the practicalities of the depot floor and peak-season constraints. He prioritizes hardware compatibility and minimal operational disruption.",
    "Misaki": "Cares about the burden on understaffed administration and the ability of crews to adopt new routines. She values high-touch support and simplicity."
  },
